<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-sanguozhi" book-id="b-sanguozhi-050" chapter-id="c-sanguozhi-050-nanyang-wang" source-id="s-sanguozhi-050-nanyang-wang">
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-050-nanyang-wang:line042" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">吳主<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-nanyang-wang:line042:m0002" ref="572_278_cba">權</persName><persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-nanyang-wang:line042:m0003" ref="61d_imj_73q">王夫人</persName>，南陽人也。以選人宮，嘉禾中得幸，生（孫）<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-nanyang-wang:line042:m0027" ref="0fo_c5c_4yh">休</persName>。及<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-nanyang-wang:line042:m0030" ref="572_278_cba_A">和</persName>為太子，<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-nanyang-wang:line042:m0035" ref="572_278_cba_A">和</persName><persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-nanyang-wang:line042:m0036" ref="rtv_1n1_nx2">母</persName>貴重，諸姬有寵者，皆出居外。夫人出公安，卒，因葬焉。<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-nanyang-wang:line042:m0063" ref="0fo_c5c_4yh">休</persName>即位，遣使追尊曰敬懷皇后，改葬敬陵。王氏無後，封同母弟<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-nanyang-wang:line042:m0091" ref="xqf_joj_874">文雍</persName>為亭侯。</p>
</text>
